fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"video/video-info-dma-drm.html#gst_video_dma_drm_format_to_gst_format","fragment":"\n\tgst_video_dma_drm_format_to_gst_format\n\n\n\tGstVideo.prototype.video_dma_drm_format_to_gst_format\n\n\n\tGstVideo.video_dma_drm_format_to_gst_format\n\nConverting a dma drm fourcc and modifier pair into a GstVideoFormat. If\nno matching video format is found, then GST_VIDEO_FORMAT_UNKNOWN is returned.\nParameters:\nthe dma drm fourcc value.\nthe dma drm modifier.\nthe GST_VIDEO_FORMAT_* corresponding to the fourcc and modifier\npair.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nConverting a dma drm fourcc and modifier pair into a GstVideo.VideoFormat. If\nno matching video format is found, then GST_VIDEO_FORMAT_UNKNOWN is returned.\nParameters:\nthe dma drm fourcc value.\nthe dma drm modifier.\nthe GST_VIDEO_FORMAT_* corresponding to the fourcc and modifier\npair.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nConverting a dma drm fourcc and modifier pair into a GstVideo.VideoFormat. If\nno matching video format is found, then GST_VIDEO_FORMAT_UNKNOWN is returned.\nParameters:\nthe dma drm fourcc value.\nthe dma drm modifier.\nthe GST_VIDEO_FORMAT_* corresponding to the fourcc and modifier\npair.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});